{"title": "Psychic Steel Virtuoso", "pageid": 27967, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psychic_Steel_Virtuoso", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Psychic Steel Virtuoso</b> is a passive feature that increases damage if you attack with advantage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wielder attacks with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>, they deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Render_of_Mind_and_Body\" title=\"Render of Mind and Body\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Render_of_Mind_and_Body\" title=\"Render of Mind and Body\">Render of Mind and Body</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Psychic Steel Virtuoso works only for attacks made by a weapon with this Psychic Steel Virtuoso.</li>\n<li>Psychic Steel Virtuoso requires an attack to have Advantage prior to the attack being made, and as such will not function with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reckless_Attack\" title=\"Reckless Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reckless Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Reckless_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reckless_Attack\" title=\"Reckless Attack\">Reckless Attack</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195234\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1522/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13047/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4687/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937205/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.032      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.032      1 -total\n 33.16%   13.607      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 29.97%   12.298      3 Template:Icon_link\n 28.85%   11.837      3 Template:Icon_text\n 27.22%   11.171     17 Template:Trim\n 22.19%    9.104      1 Template:Advantage\n 20.44%    8.386      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 19.96%    8.188      5 Template:Ifempty\n 18.18%    7.458 